{"2749880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Surviwall", "steam_appid": 2749880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR WALLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world surrounded by four towering walls, where you will survive, build, and grow in a mysterious place. Instead of a harsh and punishing survival experience, Surviwall offers a linear and streamlined survival journey focused on mystery, curiosity, and exploration...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/09227d84b85e47c58feff1abb579f541.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/09227d84b85e47c58feff1abb579f541.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/09227d84b85e47c58feff1abb579f541.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CENTRAL AREA, MYSTERY &amp; EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world within the four walls and uncover its mysteries. As you progress, the central area changes, taking you into new environments. Each transformation brings new areas to explore and new resources to collect, while opening the way to the next stage of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/655fc3a5f01872d68f406c1729a8c415.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/655fc3a5f01872d68f406c1729a8c415.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/655fc3a5f01872d68f406c1729a8c415.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRIND &amp; GATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, chop down trees, stockpile materials, and turn what you find into useful items. Resource gathering and constant progression are at the heart of Surviwall's core gameplay loop. The more you explore, the more you can collect, using what you gather to strengthen your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/5835ac43b3234e2585f44fdcc7a88994.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/5835ac43b3234e2585f44fdcc7a88994.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/5835ac43b3234e2585f44fdcc7a88994.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and level up to choose from different character upgrades. At each level, pick one of the options presented to you and add permanent improvements to your character. Take advantage of bonuses that affect your gameplay, such as resource gathering, and develop your character according to your own preferences throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/2f09a68d0dc7eae0e4dbd123df51900a.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/2f09a68d0dc7eae0e4dbd123df51900a.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/2f09a68d0dc7eae0e4dbd123df51900a.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD &amp; CRAFT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, build structures, create your own space, and produce the resources you need yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/450acd427fd085ea81011bd08ae80fa5.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/450acd427fd085ea81011bd08ae80fa5.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/450acd427fd085ea81011bd08ae80fa5.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOUR WALLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world surrounded by four towering walls, where you will survive, build, and grow in a mysterious place. Instead of a harsh and punishing survival experience, Surviwall offers a linear and streamlined survival journey focused on mystery, curiosity, and exploration...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/09227d84b85e47c58feff1abb579f541.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/09227d84b85e47c58feff1abb579f541.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/09227d84b85e47c58feff1abb579f541.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CENTRAL AREA, MYSTERY &amp; EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world within the four walls and uncover its mysteries. As you progress, the central area changes, taking you into new environments. Each transformation brings new areas to explore and new resources to collect, while opening the way to the next stage of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/655fc3a5f01872d68f406c1729a8c415.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/655fc3a5f01872d68f406c1729a8c415.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/655fc3a5f01872d68f406c1729a8c415.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRIND &amp; GATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, chop down trees, stockpile materials, and turn what you find into useful items. Resource gathering and constant progression are at the heart of Surviwall's core gameplay loop. The more you explore, the more you can collect, using what you gather to strengthen your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/5835ac43b3234e2585f44fdcc7a88994.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/5835ac43b3234e2585f44fdcc7a88994.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/5835ac43b3234e2585f44fdcc7a88994.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and level up to choose from different character upgrades. At each level, pick one of the options presented to you and add permanent improvements to your character. Take advantage of bonuses that affect your gameplay, such as resource gathering, and develop your character according to your own preferences throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/2f09a68d0dc7eae0e4dbd123df51900a.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/2f09a68d0dc7eae0e4dbd123df51900a.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/2f09a68d0dc7eae0e4dbd123df51900a.mp4?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD &amp; CRAFT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, build structures, create your own space, and produce the resources you need yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/450acd427fd085ea81011bd08ae80fa5.poster.avif?t=1788290715\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/450acd427fd085ea81011bd08ae80fa5.webm?t=1788290715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749880/extras/450acd427fd085ea81011bd08ae80fa5.m